{
  "case_id": "2024-24-7",
  "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
  "records": [
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0000-0000",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "APPEARANCES:\nJEFFREY B. WALL, ESQUIRE, Washington, D.C.; on behalf of the Petitioners.\nEDWIN S. KNEEDLER, Deputy Solicitor General, Department of Justice, Washington, D.C.; on behalf of the Federal Respondents.\nJOSHUA A. KLEIN, Deputy Solicitor General, Oakland, California; on behalf of the State Respondents."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Diamond Alternative Energy, LLC (Petitioners)",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0000-0003",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 4,
        "start": 4
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The EPA waiver here allows California to limit the number of vehicles that run on liquid fuel."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0000-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 6,
        "start": 6
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: Mr. Wall, taking a step away -- back from the evidence you just provided or the points you just made, what is your rule? How would you articulate -- articulate your categorical rule?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Diamond Alternative Energy, LLC (Petitioners)",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0000-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 6,
        "start": 6
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. WALL: Our rule is that when the government denies a party the ability to compete in a marketplace the -- and the party sues to have that market restriction lifted, there is redressability because the party is asking for the thing to be taken away that's causing its injury."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Heritage Reporting Corporation",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0001-0000",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 28,
        "start": 28
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. WALL: That's our front-line rule. If the government locks you out of a marketplace or tilts it against you and you come in to sue to have the playing field leveled, you have standing. That's our front-line rule."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0001-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 43,
        "start": 43
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SOTOMAYOR: But now we have a full record."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Joshua A. Klein",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0002-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 53,
        "start": 53
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Federal courts don't assume there's standing. The presumption runs the other way. The party who brings a case must establish that it, in fact, meets each element of standing."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0002-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 55,
        "start": 55
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: So can you -- can you say that each element of the automotive industry or manufacturing industry is satisfied or making -- adjusting to your rules?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Klein",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0002-0003",
      "kind": "stated_consequence",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 57,
        "start": 57
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Should EPA's restoration of California's waiver for the state's existing light-duty vehicle greenhouse-gas emission and ZEV standards be overturned -- should those be overturned -- it would result in higher criteria pollutant and greenhouse-gas emissions."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Barrett",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0002-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 60,
        "start": 60
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE BARRETT: So what kind of facts would you have wanted them to introduce? Like affidavits from car manufacturers?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioners",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0003-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 65,
        "start": 65
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. KLEIN: Well, Petitioners' declarations as to remedy were entirely speculative and -- sorry, not speculative. Conclusory, right? They just said this would be redressed if you strike down the law."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0003-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 66,
        "start": 66
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE ALITO: Well, just so I have it fresh in mind, could you go back to the very first question that Justice Thomas asked you: Why do you need the waiver at this point?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioners",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0003-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 67,
        "start": 67
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Your Honor, no -- I mean, we don't need the waiver for emissions control. We -- we are glad that the 2019 recission was struck down because of its erroneous substantive and procedural rulings, but this waiver is not making a difference on the ground now."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioners",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0003-0003",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 68,
        "start": 68
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "REBUTTAL ARGUMENT OF JEFFREY B. WALL ON BEHALF OF THE PETITIONERS MR. WALL: Just a few points, Your Honor. The first, Mr. Kneedler says, look, who knows what will happen in the market five, 10 years down the road."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioners",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0003-0005",
      "kind": "stated_consequence",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 71,
        "start": 71
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "uncertain",
      "text": "the EPA will withdraw the waiver and will say this waiver has been having an effect from the time it was reinstated and it is compelling automakers to make more EVs than would otherwise be produced in response to consumer demand."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2024-24-7",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-05f2a4cd4aa6-0003-0004",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 72,
        "start": 72
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The case is submitted."
    },
